WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.080
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.160 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:14.840 --> 02:16.600
In order to see the former God of War,

02:17.360 --> 02:18.680
you can even give up your life.

02:20.520 --> 02:21.520
But if you…

02:23.680 --> 02:25.000
What should I do?

03:13.400 --> 03:18.320
THIRTY THOUSAND YEARS AGO

03:28.680 --> 03:29.520
Master.

03:33.080 --> 03:34.160
I'm useless.

03:40.560 --> 03:42.200
Although I tried my best

03:44.400 --> 03:46.040
to get your primordial spirit,

03:48.720 --> 03:50.560
I still couldn't save you.

04:14.720 --> 04:17.560
She sealed 100,000 demon soldiers
with her death.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.920
Her primordial spirit is bound to perish.

04:20.000 --> 04:22.200
Even if you die with her,

04:22.280 --> 04:26.000
you can't reunite
in the Return to Ruin Realm.

04:26.080 --> 04:26.920
Who is this?

04:31.520 --> 04:32.400
Who are you?

04:36.320 --> 04:37.480
Who exactly are you?

04:49.880 --> 04:52.160
It doesn't matter who I am.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.560
What matters

04:53.640 --> 04:55.640
is that I can save her.

04:55.720 --> 04:57.040
Do you have a way to save my master?

04:58.040 --> 04:59.000
Don't you know

04:59.080 --> 05:01.440
the way to save her too?

05:01.520 --> 05:02.600
It's just that

05:02.680 --> 05:04.480
you don't want to do it.

05:04.560 --> 05:05.840
I want to do it.

05:06.400 --> 05:07.800
As long as I can save my master,

05:07.880 --> 05:09.080
I'm willing to do anything.

05:10.880 --> 05:12.360
But the Goddess of Xishan

05:12.440 --> 05:13.920
has guarded Xishan for generations

05:14.480 --> 05:15.880
and suppressed the Evil God Taisui.

05:15.960 --> 05:17.880
She contributed a lot to the three realms.

05:18.400 --> 05:19.240
Master

05:19.320 --> 05:22.120
has a close relationship
with the Xilan Tribe.

05:22.880 --> 05:24.440
And she watched the goddess grow up.

05:24.520 --> 05:25.720
Liar.

05:26.280 --> 05:27.760
You are willing to do anything?

05:27.840 --> 05:30.320
You know how to save her,

05:30.400 --> 05:32.840
but you found so many excuses.

05:32.920 --> 05:35.760
You just cherish yourself.

05:35.840 --> 05:37.800
You don't want to be sinful

05:37.880 --> 05:39.120
and fear the consequences.

05:39.200 --> 05:40.320
No.

05:40.800 --> 05:41.640
No.

05:42.640 --> 05:45.320
The Goddess of Xishan has special powers.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.320
She can make everything grow.

05:47.400 --> 05:51.560
She is the only way
to revive the high god.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.240
Take her primordial spirit

05:53.320 --> 05:55.080
and exchange one life for another.

05:55.840 --> 05:57.600
Your master died to save Shuiyuntian

05:57.680 --> 05:59.240
and all beings.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.880
What's wrong with sacrificing
a little goddess

06:01.960 --> 06:03.880
to save her?

06:04.480 --> 06:06.200
Master said she'd sacrifice
for a just cause

06:07.680 --> 06:09.200
to save all beings

06:10.080 --> 06:11.200
before the battle.

06:11.920 --> 06:13.160
It is her destiny.

06:14.120 --> 06:15.640
If I disobey my master,

06:16.600 --> 06:18.040
it would be disrespectful to her.

06:19.800 --> 06:20.720
Destiny?

06:21.800 --> 06:24.320
If those gods and immortals in Shuiyuntian

06:24.400 --> 06:25.920
aren't afraid to die,

06:26.000 --> 06:29.600
why would your master give up
her carefree days with you in Xishan

06:29.680 --> 06:31.160
and choose to die?

06:32.720 --> 06:34.920
No, that's not it.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.400
Let me ask you.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.800
Aside from you,

06:38.880 --> 06:42.000
did anyone in Shuiyuntian shed a tear

06:42.080 --> 06:43.760
for your master's death?

06:46.360 --> 06:48.640
They pretend to be sad,

06:48.720 --> 06:50.960
but they are happy deep inside.

06:51.040 --> 06:53.920
Because for them, your master's death

06:54.000 --> 06:56.800
is the good news at the end of the war

06:57.760 --> 07:00.480
and the beginning
of their continued ignoble existence.

07:01.880 --> 07:04.640
They won't be grateful

07:04.720 --> 07:07.160
to your master.

07:07.240 --> 07:11.800
You are the only one
who is sad and alone now.

07:13.320 --> 07:14.160
Master.

07:18.720 --> 07:21.000
On the riverside,

07:21.080 --> 07:22.880
in front of the bamboo forest,

07:22.960 --> 07:24.120
swordplay under the flowers,

07:24.200 --> 07:26.000
and drinking in the snow.

07:26.080 --> 07:27.800
Your master is gone.

07:27.880 --> 07:31.080
Who would you play music for from now on?

07:49.000 --> 07:50.280
Ronghao.

07:51.200 --> 07:52.760
Ronghao.

07:54.400 --> 07:57.680
To get your master back,

07:57.760 --> 07:58.920
all you need

07:59.720 --> 08:02.600
is the Goddess of Xishan.

08:11.760 --> 08:12.800
I said

08:12.880 --> 08:14.120
I only want the goddess.

08:15.600 --> 08:17.040
Stop forcing me to make a move.

08:19.720 --> 08:21.880
God of War had a great love
and sacrificed for a just cause.

08:21.960 --> 08:23.200
If she knew

08:23.280 --> 08:25.280
that her disciple massacred
the Xilan Tribe

08:25.360 --> 08:27.360
and forced the goddess to die
in order to save her…

08:27.840 --> 08:29.280
If it weren't for her,

08:30.000 --> 08:31.680
everyone in the Fairy Realm

08:32.679 --> 08:34.280
including the goddess

08:34.360 --> 08:35.760
would be long dead.

08:35.840 --> 08:38.159
Why can't a goddess die

08:38.240 --> 08:39.760
in exchange

08:39.840 --> 08:40.840
for my master?

08:40.919 --> 08:42.120
Honey!

08:57.320 --> 08:58.440
Goddess of Xishan,

08:58.520 --> 08:59.960
you are gifted and powerful.

09:00.040 --> 09:03.560
You are supposed to protect the world
but suffered this calamity instead.

09:03.640 --> 09:04.840
Today,

09:04.920 --> 09:07.560
the Xilan Tribe will seal
your divine power,

09:07.640 --> 09:09.480
memories, and appearance

09:09.560 --> 09:10.800
to avoid disaster.

09:10.880 --> 09:11.960
From now on,

09:12.040 --> 09:14.160
you'll just be an ordinary spirit
in the three realms.

09:14.240 --> 09:16.000
Even if you meet your relatives,

09:16.720 --> 09:17.800
they won't know you.

09:17.880 --> 09:19.080
There is no goddess

09:20.280 --> 09:21.560
in the world anymore.

10:01.360 --> 10:04.080
I'll keep her alive with the evil qi.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.960
But her primordial spirit is unstable.

10:06.040 --> 10:08.120
Before you find the goddess,

10:08.200 --> 10:10.360
you need to throw her into Yunmeng Lake

10:10.440 --> 10:12.840
to become a mortal
and experience tribulations.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.520
Who exactly are you?

10:16.800 --> 10:17.840
Why are you helping me?

10:19.080 --> 10:22.600
Isn't it too late to ask me that?

10:42.120 --> 10:43.000
Yes.

10:44.520 --> 10:46.480
As long as I can save my master,

10:47.880 --> 10:51.240
even if you are the Evil God Taisui
who once tried to devour the three realms,

10:52.400 --> 10:53.440
what does it matter?

10:55.720 --> 10:58.320
I like dealing with smart people.

11:01.960 --> 11:02.920
I don't understand.

11:04.440 --> 11:06.080
Didn't you get killed by the Xilan Tribe

11:06.160 --> 11:08.080
in ancient times?

11:10.480 --> 11:12.240
They can't kill me.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.360
They can only destroy my body

11:14.440 --> 11:17.440
and seal me in the Spirit-Shattering Abyss

11:17.520 --> 11:19.960
with the power of the goddess.

11:22.160 --> 11:24.800
I can feel
a surging spiritual power here indeed.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.840
That's right.

11:27.920 --> 11:31.040
The powers of 12 goddesses
are blessing this place.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.240
Everyone only knows

11:32.320 --> 11:34.440
that the Xilan Tribe
has healing abilities.

11:34.520 --> 11:37.840
The Goddess of Xilan
can also make everything grow

11:37.920 --> 11:38.800
and revive the dead.

11:38.880 --> 11:40.720
But they don't know

11:40.800 --> 11:43.640
the Xilan Tribe has been guarding Xishan
for generations

11:43.720 --> 11:45.680
to keep an eye on me

11:45.760 --> 11:48.800
and completely destroy me.

11:48.880 --> 11:50.280
From ancient times to the present,

11:50.760 --> 11:52.440
at least hundreds
of millennia have passed.

11:53.200 --> 11:54.080
I can't believe

11:55.000 --> 11:56.480
that they couldn't kill you completely.

11:57.960 --> 11:59.120
I told them.

11:59.200 --> 12:01.640
I can't be killed so easily.

12:02.600 --> 12:04.880
But if I don't have evil qi to nourish me,

12:04.960 --> 12:07.440
I'm afraid I won't last long.

12:07.960 --> 12:08.960
What is evil qi?

12:10.160 --> 12:12.280
The Xilan Tribe has pure spiritual power.

12:12.360 --> 12:15.040
And the power of the goddess
is incomparably pure.

12:15.560 --> 12:19.480
The evilest qi in the world
is needed to fight against it.

12:20.440 --> 12:22.720
But I'm trapped here.

12:22.800 --> 12:26.040
My evil qi is about to run out.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.760
So you want me to help you

12:28.760 --> 12:30.160
refine the evil qi,

12:30.640 --> 12:32.000
kill the goddess,

12:32.960 --> 12:34.720
help you get rid of the seal,

12:34.800 --> 12:36.360
and reappear in this world.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.800
That's right.

12:38.920 --> 12:40.600
What if I don't want to?

12:41.080 --> 12:42.600
Then your master

12:42.680 --> 12:44.840
will die with me.

12:44.920 --> 12:46.520
What did you do to my master?

12:47.400 --> 12:50.440
She relies on my evil qi to live.

12:50.520 --> 12:52.040
If I'm fine,

12:52.120 --> 12:54.040
she'll be alive.

12:54.800 --> 12:56.880
If there's no evil qi, I will die.

12:56.960 --> 13:00.240
And her primordial spirit will dissipate.

13:01.800 --> 13:03.040
You should know

13:03.680 --> 13:05.320
what you should do.

13:38.880 --> 13:39.760
In order to save you,

13:41.600 --> 13:43.360
so what if I go astray?

13:45.640 --> 13:47.440
So what if the three realms are destroyed?

14:00.360 --> 14:01.280
Ronghao.

14:02.040 --> 14:03.880
In order to heal you,

14:03.960 --> 14:06.400
I don't have much evil qi left.

14:07.160 --> 14:09.640
If I'm swallowed up
by the goddess's formation,

14:09.720 --> 14:12.040
the remaining spirit of your master

14:12.120 --> 14:14.640
will disappear completely.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.360
Where's the evil qi?

14:19.440 --> 14:20.920
Why don't you give him some evil qi?

14:21.920 --> 14:22.760
My lord,

14:23.560 --> 14:25.040
we have no evil qi anymore.

14:25.800 --> 14:28.480
Dongfang Qingcang destroyed Haishi
and the Soul Transformation Cauldron.

14:29.280 --> 14:30.760
Then he returned to Cangyan Sea

14:30.840 --> 14:32.280
and stopped the internal wars
of the Moon Tribe.

14:32.880 --> 14:34.760
Xunfeng cut ties with us.

14:43.640 --> 14:44.560
Don't worry.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.440
I'll go out now

14:46.520 --> 14:48.280
and continue to refine evil qi for you.

15:18.160 --> 15:19.280
These rooms

15:19.360 --> 15:21.520
are the best private rooms here.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.600
The dishes will be served soon.

15:25.200 --> 15:26.040
This way, please.

15:30.320 --> 15:32.760
On the left side,
my lord will entertain Xiao Run.

15:33.480 --> 15:36.360
On the right side,
Orchid will entertain Xie Wanqing.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.480
I will be

15:39.440 --> 15:41.320
the one in the middle.

15:42.600 --> 15:44.200
Jieli, what should I do?

15:44.280 --> 15:45.400
I've forgotten the lines

15:45.480 --> 15:46.840
I memorized last night.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.160
Please teach me again.

15:49.320 --> 15:51.200
I get angry whenever I see Xiao Run.

15:51.760 --> 15:53.880
Your plan is careless. Will that work?

15:55.400 --> 15:57.320
As long as everything goes
according to my plan,

15:57.400 --> 15:58.320
it will be fine.

15:59.560 --> 16:00.440
She's here.

16:00.520 --> 16:01.680
Lady Wanqing is here.

16:11.120 --> 16:13.520
JINGYIYA RESTAURANT

16:13.600 --> 16:15.200
Lady Wanqing, you're here.

16:15.280 --> 16:16.360
Lady Orchid.

16:17.320 --> 16:20.120
Although this restaurant claims
to be the best in Lucheng,

16:20.200 --> 16:22.760
their private brew
may not be as good as what I bought.

16:24.400 --> 16:25.560
I brought some private brews.

16:25.640 --> 16:26.920
Try it later.

16:28.880 --> 16:29.960
Go and walk around.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.880
Come pick me up after four hours.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.160
Yes.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.080
Let's go.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.480
I'm very honored

16:40.560 --> 16:41.480
to have you here.

16:41.560 --> 16:42.720
To you.

16:43.280 --> 16:44.400
Don't say that.

16:51.800 --> 16:53.040
Although I'm in a lively place

16:53.120 --> 16:55.080
like Flying Immortal Pavilion,

16:55.160 --> 16:58.320
I have never met
a good friend for many years.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.320
I didn't expect to feel so close to you

17:00.400 --> 17:02.560
after spending these few days with you.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.800
Today, I am delighted

17:05.880 --> 17:07.520
that I can drink
and enjoy myself with you.

17:08.319 --> 17:10.160
Although I just arrived in Lucheng,

17:10.240 --> 17:13.079
I know that you're famous everywhere.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.560
How can you not have a few confidants?

17:15.640 --> 17:16.680
They approached me

17:16.760 --> 17:18.079
just to use my reputation

17:18.160 --> 17:19.440
to cling to the powerful.

17:19.520 --> 17:21.680
In their hearts,
they despise my status as a prostitute.

17:21.760 --> 17:24.359
Very few people like you

17:24.440 --> 17:26.440
are purehearted and have no motives.

17:30.920 --> 17:33.000
I'm very happy

17:33.080 --> 17:34.560
to drink with you today.

17:35.320 --> 17:36.640
I have many things

17:36.720 --> 17:37.560
to share with you.

17:38.280 --> 17:39.840
Please don't complain that I'm annoying.

17:40.400 --> 17:41.520
No.

18:00.280 --> 18:02.680
I was born with a good appearance.

18:02.760 --> 18:04.320
I think I'm talented too.

18:04.880 --> 18:05.720
Over the years,

18:05.800 --> 18:07.880
countless descendants of aristocrats
have pursued me,

18:07.960 --> 18:09.680
but no one has ever impressed me.

18:10.320 --> 18:12.080
But at the Lantern Festival
a few nights ago,

18:12.880 --> 18:14.040
I met someone.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.000
I'm sorry.

18:19.080 --> 18:20.360
It's fine.

18:21.520 --> 18:23.240
Lady Wanqing, please continue.

18:24.040 --> 18:24.920
That man…

18:26.360 --> 18:27.920
That man was walking under the moon.

18:29.320 --> 18:30.920
He said a few words to me,

18:31.720 --> 18:33.440
but I forgot everything
because I was drunk.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.960
He came and left like the wind.

18:36.840 --> 18:38.720
He left no trace.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.240
But he filled

18:41.320 --> 18:42.520
my heart.

18:44.040 --> 18:45.360
The night of the Lantern Festival?

18:45.880 --> 18:46.880
Isn't that…

18:47.880 --> 18:49.240
These days,

18:49.960 --> 18:52.520
I always see him
whether I open my eyes or close my eyes.

18:53.520 --> 18:55.680
It's like grabbing a red thread
from a previous life.

18:56.360 --> 18:58.240
But I asked many people

18:58.320 --> 19:00.640
and they all said no one came that day.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.360
It's so strange.

19:04.080 --> 19:05.680
It sounds like a dream.

19:05.760 --> 19:07.080
Lady Wanqing,

19:07.160 --> 19:08.840
were you drunk?

19:09.400 --> 19:10.800
Why do you say that too?

19:11.680 --> 19:13.080
But why would I remember it so vividly

19:13.160 --> 19:14.960
if it was a dream?

19:16.000 --> 19:17.680
When he approached me,

19:17.760 --> 19:20.480
the pain of the birthmark
on the back of my neck was so clear too.

19:23.560 --> 19:28.280
JINGYIYA RESTAURANT

19:32.040 --> 19:33.640
Why isn't Xiao Run here yet?

19:34.440 --> 19:36.080
Did he go to a cricket fight again?

19:36.800 --> 19:38.080
Seeking pleasure saps the spirit.

19:38.160 --> 19:39.000
It delays things.

19:39.480 --> 19:41.480
I have to teach him a lesson.

19:44.040 --> 19:45.400
You sound like

19:46.240 --> 19:48.160
you're really his brother.

19:53.760 --> 19:54.880
Mr. Dongfang.

19:54.960 --> 19:57.520
JINGYIYA RESTAURANT

19:58.880 --> 20:00.000
Mr. Dongfang, sorry to keep you waiting.

20:00.080 --> 20:01.760
Did you go to a cricket fight
and gamble again?

20:02.400 --> 20:03.320
You've misunderstood.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.560
If I went to a cricket fight,

20:04.640 --> 20:07.600
I will definitely ask you to join me
instead of going alone.

20:09.040 --> 20:11.520
I was late today because…

20:11.600 --> 20:15.040
I've thought about it for a long time
and made an important decision.

20:15.800 --> 20:17.120
What decision?

20:17.960 --> 20:21.160
A decision that will affect my happiness
in my entire life.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.400
Let's talk inside.

20:23.280 --> 20:24.160
Let's go.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.200
Let's go.

20:27.840 --> 20:28.760
It should be upstairs.

20:29.560 --> 20:30.720
Your order is complete. Enjoy.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.040
Here, Mr. Dongfang.

20:40.440 --> 20:42.040
Tell me. What's your decision?

20:51.880 --> 20:53.040
To be honest,

20:53.520 --> 20:54.880
a beautiful woman

20:54.960 --> 20:56.000
is always in my mind

20:56.080 --> 20:57.880
these days.

20:57.960 --> 20:59.560
She is elegant,

20:59.640 --> 21:00.920
like a fairy from another world.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.400
I feel

21:03.000 --> 21:04.080
like we are destined

21:04.160 --> 21:05.480
to be together.

21:07.640 --> 21:08.760
So I decided

21:09.720 --> 21:11.200
that I'll only marry her in this life.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.160
Is he talking

21:14.680 --> 21:16.160
about Xie Wanqing?

21:21.280 --> 21:22.600
Mr. Dongfang.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.800
Do you also think

21:23.880 --> 21:25.720
that I'm too reckless?

21:25.800 --> 21:26.800
No.

21:27.880 --> 21:28.920
One's life

21:29.000 --> 21:29.960
passes by quickly.

21:30.520 --> 21:32.800
Of course it's necessary
to indulge yourself.

21:32.880 --> 21:34.160
Since you've made up your mind,

21:34.240 --> 21:35.680
just do it.

21:35.760 --> 21:37.000
I'll support you.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.840
I knew it.

21:38.920 --> 21:40.320
You know me best.

21:40.800 --> 21:41.640
Xiao Run.

21:43.880 --> 21:44.800
Everything is ready.

21:45.960 --> 21:46.920
What's ready?

21:47.600 --> 21:48.680
You'll see.

21:49.160 --> 21:50.280
Let's go.

21:57.720 --> 22:00.360
He approached you sneakily
in the middle of the night.

22:00.440 --> 22:02.200
Even if that person exists,

22:02.280 --> 22:03.200
he's not a good person.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.640
Be careful not to be fooled by him.

22:05.640 --> 22:06.960
Lady Orchid.

22:11.520 --> 22:12.960
Please forgive me.

22:13.040 --> 22:15.320
I'm just worried about you.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.080
Don't worry.

22:19.160 --> 22:20.640
If he's really a bad guy,

22:20.720 --> 22:22.000
it's good that we know.

22:22.080 --> 22:23.520
I can give up on him early on.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.000
But if this fate
really existed between us,

22:26.080 --> 22:27.120
I'll regret it

22:27.200 --> 22:28.720
for the rest of my life if I miss it.

22:32.920 --> 22:33.880
Lady Orchid,

22:34.600 --> 22:36.000
can you help me?

22:37.240 --> 22:38.120
Big Blockhead.

22:38.200 --> 22:39.400
Look at what you did.

23:24.760 --> 23:25.760
That…

23:26.800 --> 23:27.760
Isn't she

23:28.600 --> 23:29.720
Fairy Orchid?

23:30.680 --> 23:31.560
Silence!

23:31.640 --> 23:32.560
Be quiet.

23:32.640 --> 23:33.800
Listen to me.

23:34.480 --> 23:36.080
The woman in this painting

23:36.160 --> 23:37.560
is my beloved

23:37.640 --> 23:39.320
in this life.

23:45.040 --> 23:46.000
Yes.

23:46.080 --> 23:47.120
Who's that?

23:49.400 --> 23:52.400
Today, I hung this painting
in the restaurant

23:52.480 --> 23:54.040
so that if any of you

23:54.120 --> 23:55.560
knows this lady,

23:55.640 --> 23:57.720
please tell us her whereabouts.

23:57.800 --> 23:59.680
As long as the information
is true and reliable,

23:59.760 --> 24:01.520
you'll get 100 pieces of gold.

24:01.600 --> 24:03.560
- One hundred pieces of gold?
- Really?

24:08.680 --> 24:09.720
This isn't possible.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.040
I've already erased his memory

24:12.120 --> 24:13.360
with Orchid.

24:14.120 --> 24:15.640
Why does he still remember her?

24:18.120 --> 24:19.160
Please help me.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.400
Thank you.

24:22.000 --> 24:23.400
Who is so noisy?

24:23.880 --> 24:26.240
Lady Wanqing, please sit down.
I'll go and take a look.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.160
Xiao Run.

24:34.240 --> 24:36.520
Your show to save a prostitute
hasn't ended yet.

24:36.600 --> 24:38.520
And now you're acting as a beauty seeker.

24:38.600 --> 24:40.720
You're a real flirt.

24:42.800 --> 24:44.000
- Yes.
- Right.

24:44.080 --> 24:45.120
If you are looking for someone,

24:45.200 --> 24:46.400
you should at least tell us

24:46.480 --> 24:49.760
the name of the woman in this painting
and where she lives.

24:49.840 --> 24:51.560
- Right?
- Yes.

24:51.640 --> 24:52.800
To be honest,

24:53.360 --> 24:54.280
I don't know

24:54.360 --> 24:57.040
her name and family background either.

24:58.000 --> 24:59.400
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

24:59.480 --> 25:02.040
I might have stolen Chang'e's pen.

25:02.120 --> 25:04.040
Or maybe I was possessed by Yue Lao

25:04.120 --> 25:06.000
and doodled at will.

25:06.080 --> 25:07.520
I didn't expect to draw

25:07.600 --> 25:10.440
the woman I like the most.

25:12.520 --> 25:13.360
My lord.

25:14.280 --> 25:15.720
Experiencing tribulations is the priority.

25:15.800 --> 25:16.760
Calm down.

25:18.800 --> 25:19.720
Lady Orchid.

25:19.800 --> 25:20.640
Who is outside?

25:20.720 --> 25:21.560
No one.

25:21.640 --> 25:23.360
Just a bunch of alcoholics.

25:23.440 --> 25:24.920
- Let's continue.
- No way.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.040
I have a feeling

25:26.120 --> 25:27.280
that I will find her.

25:27.360 --> 25:28.400
Let me pour it for you.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.320
Maybe

25:29.840 --> 25:31.160
she is waiting for me too.

25:36.000 --> 25:37.200
Xiao Run.

25:37.280 --> 25:38.360
Everyone in Lucheng knows

25:38.440 --> 25:40.360
that your family has stopped
giving you money.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.040
If we really find her,

25:42.120 --> 25:44.120
where will you get

25:44.200 --> 25:45.600
the 100 pieces of gold as a reward?

25:45.680 --> 25:47.480
- Yes.
- Right.

25:47.560 --> 25:49.960
Will the 100 pieces of gold be on credit?

25:51.000 --> 25:52.920
- Yes.
- Yes.

25:53.000 --> 25:54.440
How is that possible?

25:55.000 --> 25:56.360
Although I have no money,

25:56.440 --> 25:59.000
Mr. Dongfang has a lot of money.

25:59.080 --> 26:00.120
So don't worry.

26:00.200 --> 26:01.160
As long as you find her,

26:01.240 --> 26:02.960
go to Night Stream Building
to get the money.

26:04.560 --> 26:06.440
I know. He's Mr. Dongfang.

26:07.640 --> 26:08.600
Mr. Dongfang.

26:08.680 --> 26:09.800
I can't thank you enough.

26:09.880 --> 26:11.480
If you hadn't encouraged me,

26:11.560 --> 26:13.080
I wouldn't dare to do this.

26:14.640 --> 26:15.560
As long as I find her,

26:16.240 --> 26:17.880
I will pay you back.

26:21.080 --> 26:22.040
My lord.

26:22.600 --> 26:24.320
Lack of forbearance spoils great plans.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.840
All right.

26:30.680 --> 26:31.720
No problem.

26:37.360 --> 26:38.200
Mr. Dongfang.

26:38.880 --> 26:42.080
Don't think that I'm usually good
at many things.

26:42.160 --> 26:43.800
But I actually lack courage.

26:44.360 --> 26:46.120
When my brother was at home,

26:46.200 --> 26:47.600
he took care of everything for me.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.880
I didn't need to worry.

26:49.600 --> 26:52.400
But he never let me make
any decisions either.

26:52.480 --> 26:54.080
He never understood me too.

26:54.760 --> 26:55.960
Mr. Dongfang.

26:56.040 --> 26:58.400
You are more like a brother to me
than my brother.

27:07.320 --> 27:08.160
Mr. Dongfang.

27:09.120 --> 27:11.360
Since we are so close,

27:11.840 --> 27:13.800
why don't we become sworn brothers today?

27:24.800 --> 27:26.720
Mr. Dongfang, don't you want that?

27:31.080 --> 27:32.480
I do.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.960
Let's pick an auspicious day--

27:36.040 --> 27:37.520
Let's do it today.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.600
Today…

27:44.320 --> 27:46.240
We didn't prepare anything.

27:46.320 --> 27:47.680
What should we prepare?

27:47.760 --> 27:49.960
Isn't that enough
that we understand each other?

27:50.800 --> 27:51.720
Wait a moment.

27:51.800 --> 27:52.680
Wait.

28:28.880 --> 28:29.760
Mr. Dongfang, hurry.

28:34.760 --> 28:35.600
Here.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.040
From now on,

28:41.120 --> 28:42.720
I, Xiao Run, and Mr. Dongfang

28:42.800 --> 28:43.920
are sworn brothers.

28:44.600 --> 28:45.720
We'll share blessings

28:45.800 --> 28:46.800
and difficulties together.

28:49.560 --> 28:50.600
Mr. Dongfang.

28:52.280 --> 28:53.120
Me too.

28:55.480 --> 28:56.320
My good brother.

28:56.880 --> 28:57.800
My good brother.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.800
You're my good brother.

29:17.920 --> 29:19.800
It's better to be a mortal.

29:21.120 --> 29:23.120
After tasting all the good wine
and delicious food,

29:23.200 --> 29:24.800
their life would be over.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.280
They don't live so long.

29:28.360 --> 29:30.000
There's nothing for them to worry about.

29:31.680 --> 29:32.560
Bad news.

29:37.520 --> 29:38.360
Look.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.200
Xiao Run did this?

29:40.800 --> 29:42.160
No.

29:42.240 --> 29:43.360
What are you waiting for?

29:44.680 --> 29:46.720
If Lady Wanqing sees this painting,

29:46.800 --> 29:48.640
our plan will be ruined.

29:48.720 --> 29:49.640
Yes.

29:49.720 --> 29:50.880
Make way.

29:55.800 --> 29:56.720
What are you doing?

29:58.800 --> 30:00.200
This is my young master's painting.

30:00.280 --> 30:01.320
You can't remove it.

30:15.640 --> 30:16.640
What are you looking at?

30:17.760 --> 30:18.800
What's your name?

30:19.440 --> 30:20.560
Have we

30:20.640 --> 30:21.880
met somewhere before?

30:26.040 --> 30:27.240
Don't try to act close with me.

30:27.720 --> 30:28.800
My young master said

30:28.880 --> 30:30.480
that no one can touch this painting.

30:31.560 --> 30:33.280
He's Xiao Run's study assistant, Qu Shui.

30:38.520 --> 30:40.120
Your name is Qu Shui, right?

30:40.200 --> 30:42.920
I don't think
you are really loyal to Xiao Run.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.240
That's nonsense!

30:44.320 --> 30:45.160
For him,

30:45.240 --> 30:46.520
I'll defy all dangers and difficulties.

30:46.600 --> 30:49.000
If you really care for him
and want what's good for him,

30:49.080 --> 30:50.400
why didn't you stop him from doing

30:50.480 --> 30:52.520
such a stupid thing
that harms others and himself?

30:53.960 --> 30:54.880
What do you mean?

30:54.960 --> 30:57.040
His absurd offering of a coral tree
from the emperor

30:57.120 --> 30:59.360
to marry a prostitute is not over yet

30:59.440 --> 31:02.560
and he's doing this today

31:02.640 --> 31:04.240
in the busiest restaurant in Lucheng.

31:04.320 --> 31:06.360
His father will definitely
find out about this

31:06.440 --> 31:07.920
and he'll get another beating.

31:08.000 --> 31:09.720
It's fine if you get a beating,

31:09.800 --> 31:11.960
but Xiao Run is a descendant of nobility

31:12.040 --> 31:13.400
with tender skin.

31:16.440 --> 31:19.120
But I can't disobey Xiao Run's order.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.480
Xiao Run trusts me the most.

31:21.160 --> 31:23.880
He told me
to keep an eye on this painting.

31:25.120 --> 31:25.960
He said

31:26.440 --> 31:28.400
that this painting
concerns his lifetime happiness.

31:29.320 --> 31:31.360
If you really care
about his lifetime happiness,

31:31.440 --> 31:33.400
you should remove this painting
as soon as possible.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.200
What do you mean?

31:37.280 --> 31:38.320
Think about it.

31:38.400 --> 31:40.960
If the painting is of a decent
and pure woman,

31:41.040 --> 31:42.480
after being publicized by him

31:42.560 --> 31:43.920
and made known to everyone,

31:44.000 --> 31:45.440
she would be embarrassed.

31:45.520 --> 31:47.040
Why would she meet him again?

31:47.120 --> 31:49.560
How can they have a lifetime of happiness?

31:50.200 --> 31:51.640
Xiao Run is ridiculous.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.800
I think you're a fool too.

31:58.960 --> 31:59.880
That makes sense.

32:01.800 --> 32:03.040
Faithful words are hard to hear.

32:03.520 --> 32:04.360
Even if

32:05.000 --> 32:06.480
Xiao Run will blame me,

32:06.960 --> 32:08.200
I must do this for his own good.

32:09.080 --> 32:09.960
I'll remove this.

32:14.280 --> 32:15.120
Stupid Black Dragon.

32:16.680 --> 32:17.840
Come here.

32:18.400 --> 32:20.720
He seems more stupid than you.

32:20.800 --> 32:21.840
How interesting.

32:23.800 --> 32:24.760
How is he interesting?

32:32.720 --> 32:33.680
Look at that.

32:37.040 --> 32:37.880
Crap.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.880
It's useless to just remove this one.

32:40.440 --> 32:41.480
Before Xiao Run came here,

32:41.560 --> 32:43.040
he asked someone
to make hundreds of copies.

32:43.120 --> 32:44.360
As soon as he gives the order,

32:44.440 --> 32:45.920
it will be posted all over the city.

32:46.000 --> 32:48.880
I'm afraid it's now posted
in the entire Lucheng.

32:54.000 --> 32:57.800
OBLIVION RIVER

33:01.760 --> 33:02.680
My lord,

33:02.760 --> 33:04.880
I'm willing to take the risk
to go to Cangyan Sea again.

33:04.960 --> 33:06.200
There's no need.

33:06.280 --> 33:08.840
After Dongfang Qingcang
and Xunfeng reconciled,

33:09.400 --> 33:12.200
I'm sure Xunfeng
will tell Dongfang Qingcang

33:12.280 --> 33:13.680
what we did.

33:14.520 --> 33:16.000
If Dongfang Qingcang knows

33:16.080 --> 33:18.680
that we are refining evil qi,

33:18.760 --> 33:20.360
he'll surely send someone to set traps

33:20.440 --> 33:21.640
and wait for us to get caught.

33:21.720 --> 33:23.320
Since Dongfang Qingcang is well-prepared,

33:23.400 --> 33:26.280
I'm afraid our plan to kill the Moon Tribe
and get the primordial spirit--

33:26.360 --> 33:27.320
Lord Ronghao.

33:35.600 --> 33:37.880
I thought I mistook you for someone else.
You're indeed him.

33:37.960 --> 33:38.960
You are…

33:39.040 --> 33:40.280
You don't remember me?

33:40.360 --> 33:43.280
I was in danger when experiencing
tribulations and you saved me.

33:43.360 --> 33:45.400
You're kindhearted. You may not remember.

33:45.920 --> 33:47.320
But Lord Ronghao,

33:47.400 --> 33:49.600
what are you doing
at the border of the two tribes?

33:51.840 --> 33:54.080
Dongfang Qingcang hurt Changheng.

33:54.160 --> 33:56.560
I heard that there are spiritual plants
and elixirs here,

33:56.640 --> 33:58.200
so I came to look for them.

33:58.760 --> 34:00.800
Do you want to go to our encampment
to have a look?

34:00.880 --> 34:02.520
There are thousands
of heavenly soldiers at the border.

34:03.000 --> 34:05.080
Tell them what spiritual plants you want.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.920
They can help you look for it
when patrolling.

34:07.480 --> 34:08.560
If that's the case,

34:08.639 --> 34:09.719
that's great.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.480
- Lord Ronghao, this way, please.
- After you.

34:25.880 --> 34:26.800
Mr. Dongfang.

34:32.639 --> 34:33.639
Do you know the feeling

34:35.000 --> 34:36.719
that there is someone in your heart,

34:37.239 --> 34:39.159
but you can't understand her thoughts

34:39.239 --> 34:40.679
and you can't express

34:41.400 --> 34:43.639
your love to her?

34:45.719 --> 34:47.400
Do you understand that, Mr. Dongfang?

34:48.280 --> 34:49.760
Mr. Dongfang.

35:04.120 --> 35:05.520
Where is the liquor?

35:06.320 --> 35:07.880
I want to drink!

35:09.680 --> 35:11.160
Stay here. I'll get you some liquor.

35:15.560 --> 35:16.760
Lady Orchid.

35:16.840 --> 35:17.720
You're agreeing?

35:20.040 --> 35:22.080
How can I refuse

35:22.160 --> 35:23.880
if you ask me like this?

35:28.840 --> 35:30.080
Lady Orchid.

35:30.160 --> 35:31.840
If I really meet the man in my dream,

35:32.400 --> 35:34.080
I don't know how to thank you.

35:34.800 --> 35:35.640
Here.

35:43.480 --> 35:44.600
Lady Wanqing.

35:44.680 --> 35:45.520
Stay here.

35:45.600 --> 35:46.720
I'll get some more liquor.

35:46.800 --> 35:48.200
All right.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.960
Follow me.

36:09.920 --> 36:10.920
What are you doing?

36:11.000 --> 36:11.840
Let go of me.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.280
- You're hurting me.
- Let me ask you.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.960
Did you secretly go
to see him again later on?

36:15.680 --> 36:16.560
Who?

36:16.640 --> 36:17.560
Who else…

36:18.480 --> 36:19.480
Who else can it be?

36:19.560 --> 36:21.000
Xiao Run, Changheng.

36:21.080 --> 36:22.240
No.

36:22.320 --> 36:24.360
Then why did he paint your painting
so clearly?

36:24.440 --> 36:25.840
How would I know?

36:25.920 --> 36:26.920
I haven't seen him

36:27.000 --> 36:28.400
since the night of the Lantern Festival.

36:28.480 --> 36:29.680
Besides,

36:29.760 --> 36:30.920
didn't you erase

36:31.000 --> 36:32.200
his memory yourself?

36:32.280 --> 36:34.680
Why are you asking me
if you didn't do it well?

36:37.480 --> 36:38.760
Forget it.

36:39.400 --> 36:40.960
It doesn't matter if you met him or not.

36:41.040 --> 36:43.200
I've already erased his memory

36:43.280 --> 36:44.720
and he still remembers you.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.800
Your fate with each other
really runs deep.

36:48.160 --> 36:49.720
Moon Supreme Lord.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.160
You're a thief who acts like a cop.

36:51.240 --> 36:52.280
What about you?

36:52.360 --> 36:53.560
What did you do to Lady Wanqing

36:53.640 --> 36:55.400
on the night of the Lantern Festival?

36:55.480 --> 36:57.200
She really cares about you

36:57.280 --> 36:59.000
and talks about you all the time.

36:59.080 --> 37:00.760
I didn't do anything.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.880
Who would believe that?

37:02.960 --> 37:03.840
Now,

37:03.920 --> 37:06.200
you're the man in Lady Wanqing's dream.

37:06.280 --> 37:08.520
She just begged me
to help her look for you.

37:08.600 --> 37:09.600
- You--
- What?

37:09.680 --> 37:11.040
Are you very happy?

37:24.080 --> 37:25.120
Mr. Dongfang.

37:31.560 --> 37:32.600
Mr. Dongfang.

37:38.560 --> 37:39.400
Mr. Dongfang!

37:41.640 --> 37:42.840
Mr. Dongfang!

37:43.960 --> 37:45.280
Don't change the topic.

37:45.360 --> 37:47.280
I think you're happy
being the fairy in the painting.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.640
- What? You're the one who's happy about--
- Who--

37:49.720 --> 37:51.400
Where are you, Mr. Dongfang?

37:52.920 --> 37:54.480
Mr. Dongfang!

37:56.200 --> 37:57.280
Lady Orchid.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.600
Where are you?

38:01.800 --> 38:02.720
Mr. Dongfang!

38:02.800 --> 38:03.720
What should we do?

38:03.800 --> 38:05.680
How would I know? Where's Jieli?

38:05.760 --> 38:08.600
- If her plan fails, I'll kill her.
- Lady Orchid.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.040
Lady Orchid.

38:13.400 --> 38:14.640
Where are you?

38:14.720 --> 38:16.360
We're doomed. Don't let her see you.

38:16.440 --> 38:17.680
Otherwise, our plan will be ruined.

38:17.760 --> 38:19.080
Go. Hide.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.080
Hurry.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.560
Mr. Dongfang.

38:29.160 --> 38:30.480
Lady Orchid.

38:34.520 --> 38:35.720
Mr. Dongfang!

38:37.360 --> 38:38.960
Where are you?

38:52.000 --> 38:53.200
Mr. Dongfang.

38:53.920 --> 38:54.960
Mr. Dongfang.

38:55.600 --> 38:56.920
Lady Orchid.

38:59.440 --> 39:00.640
Be quiet.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.480
It's too narrow here.

39:16.560 --> 39:17.400
Get out.

39:19.160 --> 39:20.120
I came in first.

39:20.680 --> 39:21.520
Get out.

39:27.400 --> 39:28.400
Mr. Dongfang!

39:29.440 --> 39:30.520
Where are you?

39:31.080 --> 39:32.480
Lady Orchid.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.160
Over here.

39:45.960 --> 39:47.040
How long have you not come?

39:48.880 --> 39:50.000
Mr. Dongfang.

39:50.480 --> 39:51.680
Lady Orchid.

39:53.680 --> 39:55.600
If they keep looking for us,

39:55.680 --> 39:57.800
will they meet each other?

39:59.080 --> 40:01.080
All this work won't be in vain at last.

40:06.120 --> 40:07.320
Mr. Dongfang.

40:08.000 --> 40:10.240
Let's keep drinking, Mr. Dongfang.

40:10.320 --> 40:11.440
Lady Orchid.

40:12.480 --> 40:13.800
- Please go upstairs.
- All right.

40:16.360 --> 40:17.480
Be careful.

40:25.640 --> 40:26.480
Well…

40:30.960 --> 40:31.800
Why…

40:31.880 --> 40:32.720
Why don't we

40:33.200 --> 40:34.600
hide somewhere else?

40:36.680 --> 40:39.240
Let's not waste our efforts.

41:09.640 --> 41:10.880
I'm starving to death

41:10.960 --> 41:11.840
after a busy day.

41:11.920 --> 41:12.920
Mr. Dongfang.

41:15.200 --> 41:16.120
Where are you?

41:25.600 --> 41:26.600
Have you seen…

41:38.160 --> 41:39.320
The fairy in the painting?

41:40.640 --> 41:41.840
The man in my dream?
